{"number":94,"nameArabic":"الشرح","nameTransliterated":"Ash-Sharh","nameTranslated":"The Relief","revelationPlace":"makkah","versesCount":8,"verses":[{"ayah":1,"verseKey":"94:1","textAr":"أَلَمۡ نَشۡرَحۡ لَكَ صَدۡرَكَ","transliteration":"Alam nashrah laka sadraka","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Did We not expand for you, [O Muhammad], your breast"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"(اے نبیؐ) کیا ہم نے تمہارا سینہ تمہارے لیے کھول نہیں دیا؟"}]},{"ayah":2,"verseKey":"94:2","textAr":"وَوَضَعۡنَا عَنكَ وِزۡرَكَ","transliteration":"WawadaAAna AAanka wizraka","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And We removed from you your burden"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور تم پر سے وہ بھاری بوجھ اتار دیا"}]},{"ayah":3,"verseKey":"94:3","textAr":"ٱلَّذِيٓ أَنقَضَ ظَهۡرَكَ","transliteration":"Allathee anqada thahraka","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Which had weighed upon your back"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"جو تمہاری کمر توڑے ڈال رہا تھا"}]},{"ayah":4,"verseKey":"94:4","textAr":"وَرَفَعۡنَا لَكَ ذِكۡرَكَ","transliteration":"WarafaAAna laka thikraka","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And raised high for you your repute"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور تمہاری خاطر تمہارے ذکر کا آوازہ بلند کر دیا"}]},{"ayah":5,"verseKey":"94:5","textAr":"فَإِنَّ مَعَ ٱلۡعُسۡرِ يُسۡرًا","transliteration":"Fainna maAAa alAAusri yusran","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"For indeed, with hardship [will be] ease"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"پس حقیقت یہ ہے کہ تنگی کے ساتھ فراخی بھی ہے"}]},{"ayah":6,"verseKey":"94:6","textAr":"إِنَّ مَعَ ٱلۡعُسۡرِ يُسۡرٗا","transliteration":"Inna maAAa alAAusri yusran","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Indeed, with hardship [will be] ease"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"بے شک تنگی کے ساتھ فراخی بھی ہے"}]},{"ayah":7,"verseKey":"94:7","textAr":"فَإِذَا فَرَغۡتَ فَٱنصَبۡ","transliteration":"Faitha faraghta fainsab","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"So when you have finished [your duties], then stand up [for worship]"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"لہٰذا جب تم فارغ ہو تو عبادت کی مشقت میں لگ جاؤ"}]},{"ayah":8,"verseKey":"94:8","textAr":"وَإِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ فَٱرۡغَب","transliteration":"Waila rabbika fairghab","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And to your Lord direct [your] longing"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور اپنے رب ہی کی طرف راغب ہو"}]}]}